  "ingredients": [
    "6 lemons",
    "1.25 cups white sugar",
    "5 cups cold water"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/PDDABd-3CpGEdXVrLsya6eQWjE0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/281089-state-fair-lemonade-VAT-005-step-01-7973df92b9b54a12822c88af2b5a0035.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/281089/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Wash lemons and peel off all the zest using a vegetable peeler; set peeled lemons aside. Add lemon zest to a bowl and cover with sugar; toss to combine. Cover and let sit for a minimum of 2 hours, or up to overnight.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/OlmczNJ26Gs81F6uJAjJ9ABn9hk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/281089-state-fair-lemonade-VAT-006-step-02-ae96cbec13d043668dce44bae854cc04.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/281089/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bring water to a boil in a pot over high heat; turn off heat and pour in lemon-sugar mixture. Stir and let sit until sugar is completely dissolved, about 5 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/HMLJrCq7r6jwwrAtlcobQnWi4-w=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/281089-state-fair-lemonade-VAT-007-step-03-093b393c8917490895f4826ae0f2849a.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/281089/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour through a mesh strainer back into the same bowl and discard the zest. Let cool to room temperature, 20 to 30 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/T7CXWtThGcejt52oELyNuDZ_Kjw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/281089-state-fair-lemonade-VAT-008-step-04-943ea4841ba5426190cc07adfdba77be.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/281089/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cut lemons in half and squeeze juice into the bowl. Pour lemonade into a serving pitcher; cover and chill thoroughly before serving over ice, at least 2 hours.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/nAVyHlBocgDr9RF7JjAQAAdyU0s=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/281089-state-fair-lemonade-VAT-009-step-05-f17c2956db9c419eb9e7a0cd555822ba.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/281089/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Enjoy!",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/OGFkbmNSVOx9PDdfCHn6q4kMNbg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/281089-state-fair-lemonade-VAT-001-4x3-ad98a7e4ae144fffb4662930d489d136.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/281089/step_06.webp"
    }
